<title>USA: West Virginia approves $550 mln road GO bonds.</title>
<headline>West Virginia approves $550 mln road GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in West Virginia Tuesday overwhlemingly approved Amednment No. 3, which would allow the state to sell up to $550 million general obligation bonds for improvement and construction of state roads.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
